  kappa =  0, delta_S = 20: Lambda_2 =   72.19, c_+ = 9.595865e-07 = 1.00620 * 2^-m; (ii)(b) bound at c_+: -1.0e-16, at c = 1e-4: 0.011104 (H(p) = 0.011174)
  kappa = 30, delta_S =  0: Lambda_2 =  112.19, c_+ = 9.628942e-07 = 1.00967 * 2^-m; (ii)(b) bound at c_+: -8.7e-18, at c = 1e-4: 0.011066 (H(p) = 0.011174)
  kappa = 30, delta_S = 20: Lambda_2 =  132.19, c_+ = 9.645566e-07 = 1.01141 * 2^-m; (ii)(b) bound at c_+: -1.4e-16, at c = 1e-4: 0.011047 (H(p) = 0.011174)
  Paper 2 (rem:teacher:numbers): window (9.54e-7, 8.06e-3] at kappa = 0, (9.54e-7, 3.65e-3] at kappa = 30, so c_+ < c_hi.

